@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
title Proposed — Sequence: explicit publication object collaboration
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 65

actor Owner
participant "entry : Controller" as C
participant "handler : PublishRevisionHandler" as H
participant "authority : ResourceAuthority" as A
participant "draft : ResumeDraft" as D
participant "store : PublicationStore" as S
Owner -> C : confirm publication of expected draft
C -> H : handle(intent with command identity)
H -> A : requirePublish(actor, resume)
A --> H : eligible context or denial
alt denied
 H --> C : denied; protected state unchanged
else eligible for guarded commit
 H -> D : snapshot(expectedDraftVersion)
 D --> H : snapshot or version conflict
 alt conflict
  H --> C : conflict; no new publication
 else snapshot available
  H -> S : commitConfirmedRevision(intent, snapshot)
  note right of S
   Revalidate relevant current guards at commit;
   coordinate authority revocation ordering.
   Resolve same command identity; atomically record
   revision, live pointer and attributable result.
  end note
  S --> H : committed / conflict / denied / actual failure
  H --> C : truthful bounded outcome
 end
end
C --> Owner : outcome or recover same command after lost response

@enduml
